    "title": "Maine raises concealed carry permit fees - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WGME Staff ,\n3 hours ago AUGUSTA, Maine (WGME) -- Starting Wednesday, Mainers hoping to get a concealed carry permit for a handgun will have to pay a little bit extra. The cost for a new permit from State Police is now $50 for residents, and the new cost to renew your permit is $35. People... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
